Description: Mainuan Kernel Installer - Kernel manager GUI for Linux (Ubuntu Family)
 Graphical interface for downloading, compiling and installing Linux kernels,
 installing pre-built RT, LTS and XanMod kernels, testing the hardware to
 recommend a compatible kernel and removing installed kernels.
 .
 Optimized for Ubuntu and its derivatives (Kubuntu, Mint, Pop!_OS, Elementary).
